ent by inserting the lead\ninto the channel on the body.</p><p>Bring the wiring inside the passenger compartment and\nthen connect the control unit electrical connections and the earth\nlead on the pillar.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Engine management ECU</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890762\">M10</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Accelerator pedal potentiometer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890668\">K55</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Tighten the nuts securing the injection\nwiring flange to the body.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891352\">1008C16</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891350\">1008C10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891304\">1080D34</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891253\">1048A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891911\">5530B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891354\">1016A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892256\">7055A18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891847\">5050B32</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892180\">7040A96</a></p>"]]